'''
Chapter1, topic - managing API costs and token usage
'''
# =====================================================================
# 🧠 CORE TOKENS & COST DEFINITIONS
# =====================================================================
# Token       -> The basic puzzle piece of text processed by AI models.
#                Roughly equal to 4 characters or 0.75 English words.
# Input Token -> Text sent INTO the model (Instructions + Prompt Context).
#                Charged at a lower baseline rate.
# Output Token-> Text generated BY the model (AI Responses).
#                Significantly more expensive (typically 3x to 4x input cost).
# Tiktoken    -> OpenAI's open-source library used to calculate token counts
#                locally and instantly without incurring network or API costs.

# =====================================================================
# 🤖 MODEL TIER & SELECTION MATRIX
# =====================================================================
# ⚡ Lightweight (e.g., `gpt-4o-mini`):
#   - High-speed, incredibly low cost (roughly 20-30x cheaper than flagship).
#   - Perfect for 90% of routine automation tasks (classification, cleaning).
# 🧠 Heavyweight (e.g., Flagship `gpt-4o`):
#   - Advanced logical reasoning, deep synthesis, high cost.
#   - Reserved exclusively for highly complex logic or software engineering.

# =====================================================================
# 🛡️ THE PRODUCTION-GRADE GUARDRAIL MATRIX
# =====================================================================
# 🪟 Max Tokens Limit:
#   - Always explicitly declare `max_tokens` to cap runaway responses.
#   - Essential to prevent paying for infinite hallucination or loop output.
# 🚧 Pre-Flight Token Gates:
#   - Intercept incoming web-scraped data or payloads locally via `tiktoken`.
#   - Abort operations or truncate text BEFORE transmitting across the network.
# ❄️ Rolling History Truncation:
#   - Trim or compress conversational/email histories to avoid token snowballs.
#   - Pass only a tight context window or a condensed AI-generated summary.

# =====================================================================
# 🪄 THE AUTOMATION MINDSET MAGIC SPELL
# =====================================================================
# "Filter locally, cap globally, and never pay an AI to do what basic 
# Python can execute for free."
# =====================================================================
